WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
to hunt for oil, but we don't have to do much hunting

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.600
because we have the most oil of any nation anywhere.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.920
Oil and gas in the world.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.840
And if you add coal,

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.480
we have the most of any nation in the world.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.480
Clean, I call it clean, beautiful coal.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.959
You can do things today with coal

00:00:16.959 --> 00:00:19.799
that you couldn't have done 10 years ago, 15 years.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.139
So I have a little standing order in the White House.

00:00:23.139 --> 00:00:24.520
Never use the word coal.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.879
Only use the words clean, beautiful coal.

00:00:27.879 --> 00:00:29.959
Sounds much better, doesn't it?

00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:32.119
But we stand ready to provide any country

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:34.279
with abundant, affordable energy supplies

00:00:34.279 --> 00:00:35.919
if you need them, when most of you do.

